legend top
  BackgroundColor White
  FontColor Black
  **🎯 Key Success Factors for LLM Pattern Discovery:**
  1. Context-Rich Prompting: Include relevant domain knowledge and templates, concrete examples, specify output format, chain-of-thought reasoning
  2. Multi-Modal Evidence Integration: Combine LLM reasoning with template matching, GUI evidence, business document cross-check
  3. Iterative Refinement: Continuous prompt optimization, template updates, fine-tuning, expert feedback loop
  4. Uncertainty Management: Explicit confidence scoring, graceful degradation, human-in-the-loop, alternative suggestions
end legend

:🎯 Phase 1: Context Preparation;
note right
  📊 Gather Context Information:
  • Current GUI entities
  • Existing BPG fragments
  • Domain specification
  • Business documents
  • User behavior patterns

  🏷️ Load Relevant Templates:
  ''python
  relevant_templates = template_kb.query(...)
  template_context = format_for_llm(...)
  ''

  **Performance Targets Phase 1:**
  • Ensure all relevant context is loaded
  • Validate template queries return results
end note

:🧠 Phase 2: LLM Entity Analysis;
note right
  🤖 LLM Entity Classification:
  ''python
  System: You are a business process expert analyzing a web application...
  ''

  📊 Parse LLM Response:
  ''json
  {
    "entity_classifications": [...]
  }
  ''

  **Performance Targets Phase 2:**
  • Entity Classification Accuracy: >85%
  • Coverage of GUI entities: >90%
  • Confidence calibration: well-calibrated
end note

:🔗 Phase 3: Relationship Inference;
note right
  🎯 Template-Guided LLM Analysis:
  ''python
  System: Analyze potential relationships based on patterns...
  ''

  📈 Confidence Scoring:
  ''python
  def calculate_relationship_confidence(...):
      return weighted_average([...])
  ''

  **Performance Targets Phase 3:**
  • Precision: >80% for high-confidence relationships
  • Recall: >70% for template-based relationships
  • False positive rate: <15%
end note

:⚙️ Phase 4: Process Pattern Suggestion;
note right
  🔍 Multi-level Pattern Recognition:
  ''python
  System: Identify business process patterns from entities and relationships...
  ''

  📊 Pattern Validation:
  ''python
  for suggested_pattern in llm_suggested_patterns:
      pattern_confidence = combine_evidence(...)
  ''

  **Performance Targets Phase 4:**
  • Pattern match accuracy: >75%
  • Novel pattern identification: >60%
  • Business rule compliance: >95%
end note

:✅ Phase 5: Validation & Refinement;
note right
  🔍 Cross-validation Analysis:
  • Compare LLM suggestions with template predictions
  • Check for inconsistencies
  • Validate business rule compliance
  • Assess pattern completeness

  📊 Uncertainty Quantification:
  ''python
  uncertainty_analysis = {...}
  ''

  👥 Expert Review Preparation:
  • Generate summaries
  • Highlight uncertainties
  • Prepare alternatives
  • Format for expert validation

  **Phase 5 Notes:**
  • Include human-in-the-loop for critical validation
  • Ensure traceability of uncertainty scores
end note

:📚 Phase 6: Knowledge Base Integration;
note right
  💾 Template Enhancement:
  ''python
  template_kb.update_relationship_confidence(...)
  template_kb.add_pattern_template(...)
  ''

  🔄 LLM Prompt Refinement:
  ''python
  prompt_optimizer.enhance_entity_classification_prompt(...)
  prompt_optimizer.enhance_relationship_prompt(...)
  ''

  **Implementation Considerations:**
  • LLM Integration: GPT-4, Claude, local fine-tuned models
  • Prompt Engineering: Domain-specific templates, few-shot, chain-of-thought
  • Quality Assurance: Multi-model consensus, expert validation, automated checks
  • Scalability: Batch processing, caching, incremental learning, distributed execution
end note

